================================================================================
UI Design & Inspiration
================================================================================

- Frigate NVR Web UI (https://github.com/blakeblackshear/frigate)
  The layout and user experience of the camera grid, events & reviews browser,
  severity indicators, vertical 24-hour motion/activity timeline ruler, scrub
  preview HUD, and object bounding-box overlays are inspired by Frigate's web
  interface, adapted natively for Android wall tablets using Kiosk Satellite's
  overlay SDK.

================================================================================
Kiosk Satellite Plugin SDK & Template
================================================================================

Parts of the SDK interfaces, manifest utilities, and packaging toolchain in
`sdk/`, `tools/`, and `package_plugin.py` are derived from the official
Kiosk Satellite plugin template and SDK:
- Kiosk Satellite (https://github.com/jxlarrea/kiosk-satellite)
- Kiosk Satellite Plugin SDK / Template — Licensed under the Apache License 2.0

